# cnsqdesigns — Netlify redirects
# =====================================================================
# This file is for REDIRECTS ONLY. Headers and build settings live in
# netlify.toml (which takes precedence over this file for redirects, so
# never put a redirect in both places).
#
# Syntax:  /from  /to  [status]
#   * 301 = permanent move. Use this for the Canva migration: it transfers
#     the ranking signal from the old URLs to the new ones.
#   * 302 = temporary. Use only for convenience aliases.
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; the first match wins, so specific
# paths must come before wildcards.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Active: friendly aliases for brand assets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Short URLs that are easy to say out loud, print on a business card, or
# hand to a client. /cnsqdesigns-resume.pdf is the canonical filename
# (brand naming convention: cnsqdesigns-*).
/resume            /cnsqdesigns-resume.pdf            302
/cv                /cnsqdesigns-resume.pdf            302

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ACTION REQUIRED before launch: Canva Sites -> cnsqdesigns
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canva generates opaque paths (/about-1, /our-work, /services-2, ...).
# Replace the commented examples below with the REAL paths from the Canva
# export or the old Netlify deploy log, then uncomment them. Every one that
# is missed is a broken link a potential client will hit, and a 404 where a
# search engine previously ranked the page.
#
# Mapping conventions used by this site's anchors:
#   About    -> /#about
#   Work     -> /#gallery
#   Services -> /#services
#   Contact  -> /#contact
#
# /about-1          /#about       301
# /about-us         /#about       301
# /our-work         /#gallery     301
# /portfolio        /#gallery     301
# /work             /#gallery     301
# /services-2       /#services    301
# /services         /#services    301
# /contact-us       /#contact     301
# /contact-1        /#contact     301

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
